  "source_sha256": "25ff608b07fa6bfc2bfa4ee1d98b4077f5e29078f9824e0bc86f509e2a2b206e",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c06c3b8b00f27102b109bcdbef37c14ef8e9065b9a84153d5b52b65778a6a2f2",
      "text": "Sun Wukong’s\nNoisy Nap",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae37abced2eda6efea9a4ee1c9920e07c2fa74cfcfb121b3f340ece3cf0f8656",
      "text": "Sun Wukong yawned.\n“Time for a nap!”\nHe found a shady peach tree.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "057aa669b52f637a972fa54bad7a7f8ea90e339550ac4a7b045e382d607128bb",
      "text": "Pigsy brought a pillow.\n“Soft as a cloud!”\nThen his tummy went\nRUMBLE.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37b0d638e42f1852f9c072f122a1091f5c822bd151da835b7200e2a7acbf18f9",
      "text": "“A snack first,” said Wukong.\nMunch, munch.\nPigsy’s tummy grew quiet.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "19fbf9eed30e33bca0a148d4b086b890d9fb7229d69a630c75d29c0b82120444",
      "text": "Sandy waved a leaf fan.\nA leaf tickled Wukong’s nose.\n“Ah… ah… ACHOO!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a17edb611c8f59756877cb08a474daec5528b6ff2879659af450bb8ca84ec7e3",
      "text": "A little bird sang a song.\n“TWEET! TWEET!”\nWukong sat up.\n“A little softer, please!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "10fa5e2aa6127cd052c95a99ce79752604d71dcc41e6b4497ec13f554cdd7b98",
      "text": "Pigsy chewed softly.\nSandy fanned slowly.\nThe bird sang, “Twee…\ntwee…”\nWukong smiled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2eafcc6c2b418fc625f62e4d5a524c3f2bcef960ab5c6915417762909daf7119",
      "text": "Wukong blew one tiny puff.\nA little cloud curled around\nhis feet.\n“Just right,” he whispered.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f83ce7872a909727191778fe35d125a33fad2e17e2b078e54f8269f246a53a54",
      "text": "Soon, his friends were sleepy\ntoo.\nPigsy snored. “Snrrr…”\nWukong gave one last giggle.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2631da7b69edd87bb37debd6f34fdcd49dae10d7ec2224734bc5a0702557bfa",
      "text": "Under the peach tree,\neveryone slept.\nThe leaves went hush.\nThe clouds drifted by.\nEven heroes need a nap.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b94c8febe5feb6a7e982144d0c240be01010efc5f336537724b56e5cfcd50ae",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.",
